| Dataset Condition        | Recommended Model |
| ------------------------ | ----------------- |
| Stationary data          | AR, MA, ARMA      |
| Non-stationary data      | ARIMA             |
| Seasonal data            | SARIMA            |
| Trend + Seasonality      | SARIMA            |
| Simple baseline forecast | Moving Average    |

========

Typical Workflow

| Step | Action                                         |
| ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| 1    | Plot the time series                           |
| 2    | Check stationarity using ADF Test              |
| 3    | If non-stationary, apply differencing (find d) |
| 4    | Check ACF plot (find q)                        |
| 5    | Check PACF plot (find p)                       |
| 6    | Build candidate models                         |
| 7    | Compare AIC/BIC/RMSE                           |
| 8    | Select the best model                          |

